      "name": "SwiftDrop Delivery Analytics",
      "summary": "SwiftDrop is a fictional last-mile delivery company operating across Lagos, Abuja, and Kano, Nigeria. Analysts use Python/pandas to clean, reshape, and summarise order data exported from the dispatch system. The scenario provides a consistent set of tables — orders, drivers, customers, and monthly delivery summaries — that recur across all pandas tiles in this batch.",
